  "content": "<p><strong>This is demonstration content for the news portal.</strong></p><p>Small businesses in Pokhara are expanding their use of QR payments and simple digital bookkeeping systems.</p><h2>Why adoption is growing</h2><p>Business owners say customers increasingly prefer cashless payments, while digital records make it easier to track daily sales.</p><ol><li>Faster checkout</li><li>Clearer transaction records</li><li>Reduced need to handle cash</li></ol><p>Owners also note that staff training and reliable internet access remain important.</p>",
